      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "notes": "Critical: without alwaysOutputData, an invitee email with no matching lead (a normal, expected case - e.g. someone books without going through the funnel) returns 0 rows, which kills every downstream node including the unmatched-booking handling that CODE - Check Lead Found was clearly written to support. Without this flag the webhook never responds at all.",
